WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.540
Who are you staying with right now?

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.450
Are you staying with family?

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.680
Well, yes, I came,

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.231
I came to see my mum.

00:00:06.231 --> 00:00:09.440
And my sister who are here.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.380
I'm not actually in
the same house as them.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.390
But yes, I came to see my
mum, my chain smoking mother,

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:18.280
who is assuring me, that
she's protecting herself

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.360
from coronavirus with smoking.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:26.360
Which she read on some
dark web, protects you.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.660
So she she's gone from
smoking a packet a day,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.550
to now she's up to probably two packs,

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:36.264
because she's convinced
it's saving her life.

00:00:36.264 --> 00:00:38.490
And she's read somewhere that in France,

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.710
they even put nicotine
patches on corona patients,

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:43.220
which I actually believe.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.340
I think it seems very French.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.790
But I'm not sure that she's,

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.800
I don't know whether her
theory is true. (laughs)

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.160
And I keep saying to her
mum, this is really worrying.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.420
Can you please stop smoking?

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.253
And she says, "Darling."

00:00:56.253 --> 00:00:58.787
Her answer is, "Darling.
I don't have a dry cough.

00:00:58.787 --> 00:01:01.489
"I've got a very fruity cough."

00:01:01.489 --> 00:01:02.883
(Conan laughs)

00:01:02.883 --> 00:01:05.193
Which indeed, (laughs) indeed she does.

00:01:06.947 --> 00:01:08.518
Let me jump in here and just,

00:01:08.518 --> 00:01:11.060
all due respect to your mom,

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.730
this is terrible advice
for anybody out there.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.860
You do not want to be smoking
and combat coronavirus.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.990
There's no evidence that.

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:22.080
I mean, listen, I don't
wanna get into a fight

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.241
with your mom, but she
sounds like the kind

00:01:25.241 --> 00:01:28.270
who always wants to be smoking.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:30.711
Coronavirus, no
coronavirus, is that right?

00:01:30.711 --> 00:01:32.730
Yes, She's just upped it.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.400
She's just upped it a lot.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.210
And now she's, she
feels that she's totally

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:38.980
within her rights to close all the doors

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:41.660
and all the windows and, you know,

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.060
expose us to sort of second-degree
lung cancer. (laughs)

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.703
While she protects her own health

00:01:47.703 --> 00:01:49.103
(laughing) by chain smoking.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.730
Now, I know you have kids.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:54.830
How are your kids doing with
the quarantine in isolation?

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:56.690
Are they okay?

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.294
They've been really good.

00:01:58.294 --> 00:02:01.940
They've very brave and
much more kind of stoic,

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:04.140
in a way, than anyone else.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.970
But there are the odd
moments of lapses where,

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.730
me and my husband were in the,

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.990
I think we were upstairs
and they were downstairs

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.350
at one point in the midst of it all.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.660
And we heard our daughter, who's 10,

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:18.833
say very loudly to our son, who's 16,

00:02:20.029 --> 00:02:22.997
(laughs) "Can you stop farting in my face?

00:02:22.997 --> 00:02:25.560
"I'm just trying to survive here!"

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.810
(Conan laughs)
which I felt just about

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:31.570
summed up the experience
(laughs) for all of us.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:35.014
I would prefer your mom's
cigarette smoke, I think.

00:02:35.014 --> 00:02:35.847
(laughing) Yeah, exactly.

00:02:35.847 --> 00:02:38.713
Starting to look really,
really good to me.

